/P 235 0 R
/E (The first day of the internship marked the beginning of my journey into the field of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning through Python programming. The session started with an introduction to Python, including its history, creator Guido van Rossum, and its importance in AI, Machine Learning, Data Science, Web Development, and Automation. The trainers explained why Python is one of the most popular programming languages due to its simplicity, readability, and extensive collection of libraries. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
